    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat: fixed-layout manga spread, zoom &amp;amp; perf

- honor OPF rendition:spread in auto mode (bibi-style)
- auto-pair no-marker manga (cover alone, then two-up)
- zoom &amp;amp; pan in paginated mode (ctrl+wheel/pinch/dblclick/drag)
- virtualize continuous strip; prefetch neighbor pages&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
